  "description": "Scryber is an advanced PDF generation engine based around HTML templates with CSS styles and SVG drawing. It includes full flowing pages, dynamic template binding on your object model and referenced external files, images, css and fonts. \nEasily create documents from your Apps, MVC sites, or Javascipt ajax calls.\n\nThis framework is built entirely in .NET supporting Blazor WASM and is released under the LGPL licence so you can use to it in commercial applications.",
